<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - W.W. Grainger started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - W.W. Grainger started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of W.W. Grainger Inc with a market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1-1/8 at 76-5/8.</p>
</text>
